      "message": "It used to crash, but not with l.5953 which catches it.\n\nNRIs are not supposed to be added somewhere else, but it\u0027s just in case. I think what I\u0027m trying to catch here is the case where somehow the NRI was added to the map with N requests but unregistered with \u003c N requests, and therefore remains. The bug report exemplifying the crash suggests this as one of the possible causes.\n\nI mean, the request array is supposed to be an immutable list pointing to a copy of what was passed, so I don\u0027t see how this could happen. But then again, I\u0027ve looked at the code for hours, and I don\u0027t see how any of this happens, so I prefer to check eagerly.",
